<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in Feb 5 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in Feb 5 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED FEBRUARY 5</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............795,300 up.....4,100</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......706,300 down...3,300</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......529,400 up.....2,800</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....821,721 up.....4,591</p>
<p> Financial companies.......626,009 up.....4,320</p>
<p> New York business loans....44,198 up.......700</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......43,965 up.......699</p>
</text>
